r />Van Asch van Wijckstraat 55G </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 42.5pt 0cm 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">3811 LP Amersfoort</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Nederland</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029873","display":"11. NAAM EN ADRES VAN DE HOUDER VAN DE VERGUNNING VOOR HET IN DE HANDEL BRENGEN"}]}},{"id":"690afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"12. NUMMER(S) VAN DE VERGUNNING VOOR HET IN DE HANDEL BRENGEN","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">RVG 31377</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029874","display":"12. NUMMER(S) VAN DE VERGUNNING VOOR HET IN DE HANDEL BRENGEN"}]}},{"id":"6a0afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"13. PARTIJNUMMER","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Lot {nummer}</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029875","display":"13. PARTIJNUMMER"}]}},{"id":"6b0afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"14. ALGEMENE INDELING VOOR DE AFLEVERING","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">UAD</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029876","display":"14. ALGEMENE INDELING VOOR DE AFLEVERING"}]}},{"id":"6c0afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"15. INSTRUCTIES VOOR GEBRUIK","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Lokale verlichting van milde tot matige gewrichtspijn van knie of vingers. </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">4 maal per dag aanbrengen op de te behandelen zone gedurende maximaal 3 weken.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lightgrey;\">Doseer- en smeerdop instructie</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lightgrey;\">(Afbeelding 1): Trek de transparante beschermdop van de tube.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lightgrey;\">(Afbeelding 2): Draai de oranje applicator los</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lightgrey;\">(Afbeelding 3): Gebruik de inkeping aan de zijkant van de applicator om de verzegeling van de tube te verwijderen</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lightgrey;\">(Afbeelding 4): Draai de applicator weer op de tube en trek aan het witte uiteinde om te openen.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: lightgrey;\">(Afbeelding 5): Knijp in de tube voor de gewenste hoeveelheid emulgel. Breng aan op de huid. De dop wordt automatisch gesloten.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Website</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><a href=\"http://www.voltaren.nl\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">www.voltaren.nl</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029877","display":"15. INSTRUCTIES VOOR GEBRUIK"}]}},{"id":"6d0afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"16. INFORMATIE IN BRAILLE","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">voltaren emulgel</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029878","display":"16. INFORMATIE IN BRAILLE"}]}},{"id":"6e0afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"17. UNIEK IDENTIFICATIEKENMERK - 2D MATRIXCODE","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">&#160;</div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029879","display":"17. UNIEK IDENTIFICATIEKENMERK - 2D MATRIXCODE"}]}},{"id":"6f0afa5d-055d-ee11-be6f-000d3aaa06fe","title":"18. UNIEK IDENTIFICATIEKENMERK - VOOR MENSEN LEESBARE GEGEVENS","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">&#160;</div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029880","display":"18. UNIEK IDENTIFICATIEKENMERK - VOOR MENSEN LEESBARE GEGEVENS"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029862","display":"GEGEVENS DIE OP DE BUITENVERPAKKING EN DE PRIMAIRE VERPAKKING MOETEN WORDEN VERMELD DOOS"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029861","display":"ETIKETTERING"}]}}]}}]}